digraph account_payable_process_101 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_EZST" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_EZST"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_EZST" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_EZST" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_EZST" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_EZST"
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_EZST"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_EZST" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
Once sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: confirming all documents have been amended, reporting errors to relevant team member. 
After confirming all documents have been amended, doubling check a three-way match should be done. 
Afterwards, checking dates to avoid penalty charges needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process that begins when you email to the vendor's accounting department.
Once the sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be made.
Once creation of a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following path should be executed: confirming all documents have been amended, reporting error to the relevant team member.
After confirming all documents have been amended, the double check should do a three-way match.
Afterwards, checking of dates to avoid penalty fees must be done.
The process is now complete.
"
}
